  message: "Merged as PR #3906, dev SHA 1dd5ac8e48. First-try CI pass, no gremlin. Single-emit refactor: Case 1 / Case 3 / Case 3.5 paths stash hints (pr4_enclosing_class_hint / pr4_receiver_type_hint / pr4_inherited_field_receiver) and all three threaded into the single final make_unresolved_edge call at java.py:~1722, eliminating PR-3's double-emit on bare/this inherited calls while preserving static_imports/wildcard_imports/dst_ref. Caught the design weakness of a simpler one-line edge_added=True fix via polyglot-call-site-coverage test on import-static singletonList. 6 new TestJavaSite2Site3UnresolvedHints tests, all 10 polyglot cases still pass. Java analyzer 100% coverage on 885 statements. Tag awaits_bakeoff_validation attached BEFORE auto-pr. Bakeoff signal: Java unresolved-edge count decreases by ~count of ast_call_inherited resolved edges (one redundant unresolved removed per bare/this inherited site); no decrease in is_resolved=True count. Unblocks WI-puvil (PR-5 Java Sites 2+3 lift)."  # 218e
